    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active SBQQ__Subscription__c records with no corresponding Asset record.
Why it matters: The subscription is billing but the org has no Asset record — provisioning, renewal, and amendment flows all depend on Asset. Missing Assets mean broken renewal lookups and asset-based pricing failures.
Suppress a finding: for subscriptions intentionally tracked without Assets.
Disable the detector: only if your model doesn&apos;t use Assets. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
